[h1]Geb's Flora & Fauna[/h1]
Expand the wilderness of DayZ with new animals, fungi, harvestable resources, and survival crafting.

Geb's Flora & Fauna makes the world feel more alive without turning wildlife into an effortless food source. Server owners control which species appear, where they live, and how common they are through DayZ's Central Economy. Preparation time, harvested resources, and population balance remain important parts of survival.

Each supported animal has its own behavior and harvestable resources. Depending on the species, survivors may recover unique meat, pelts, tails, tusks, guts, bones, or lard. The mod also adds 44 fungi to forage: 24 edible species and 20 poisonous look-alikes, from chanterelles and morels to the deadly death cap, plus a craftable raccoon-skin cap. Gardeners can grow corn, okra, green beans, onions and garlic from Geb's Garden seed packets.

[url=https://discord.gg/G8uSGZ8yyf][img]https://i.imgur.com/4IyA522.png[/img][/url]

