[h1]Server Installation & Central Economy[/h1]
This mod does not replace vanilla wildlife. Server owners choose which custom animals spawn by adding them to the mission's Central Economy animal events and map territories.

[url=https://packjc.github.io/gebsflorafauna/#install]Open the complete server-owner installation and Central Economy guide[/url]

The guide covers:
[list]
[*]Installing and loading the Workshop mod
[*]Adding animal events to db/events.xml
[*]Adding map territories to cfgeventspawns.xml
[*]Balancing populations without suppressing vanilla wildlife
[*]Validating XML and troubleshooting server logs
[/list]

[h1]Classnames[/h1]
[url=https://packjc.github.io/gebsflorafauna/#classnames]Open the searchable classname database[/url]

The website includes all 39 public animal, fungus, meat, pelt, resource, and crafting classnames with one-click copy controls.

[h1]Usage & Terms[/h1]
[b]This item is NOT authorized under any of the following conditions:

- Posting or re-uploading it to Steam except under the Steam account Cole.
- Hosting it on any download server other than the current Geb's Flora & Fauna Workshop download.
- Hosting it on any launcher for distribution other than the current Workshop download.
- Packaging or repacking it in any form outside the current Workshop download.
- Creating derivative works from this mod.[/b]

[h1]NO SERVER PACKS OR MOD PACKS[/h1]
[b]Permission is not granted for this mod to be included in a server pack or mod pack.[/b]

Use a Steam Collection if you want to include Geb's Flora & Fauna in your server's required mod list.

